pic markers on BAL T-lymphocytes in hypersensitivity pneumonitis, pulmonary sarcoidosis and bronchiolitis obliterans with organizing pneumonia</article-title><source>Eur Respir J</source><year>1993</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>477</fpage><lpage>482</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8491296</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>